WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.733
Graphs and word problems

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:10.300
The children in our class were asked which fruit they like best. Let us show the answers on a graph.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.833
Seven children liked bananas, five liked mangoes and three liked oranges.

4
00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:20.633
We colour one box for each child; the tallest bar is bananas.

5
00:00:20.633 --> 00:00:23.567
Bananas have two more than mangoes.

6
00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:28.667
Altogether seven, five and three make fifteen children.
